From 3030a8778206829e882b6edd8b8070975a492f12 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:03:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 61/63] cmd: the network quality, STUN and schema tools left
 out of the slim engine
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The slim engine is what podkop runs on a router, and podkop runs none of them (podkop 0.7.24 calls
sing-box version, tools decode-link, tools fetch and rule-set decompile; podkop-experimental embeds
the engine). With them go the code of networkquality and stun: 328 KB of the arm64 binary and 459
KB of the mipsle one (1.4–1.7 %), and as much of the memory a running sing-box keeps of its file.
The full engine and builds without the podkop tags keep them.

Pdk-Feature: slim-tools
Pdk-Zone: build
Pdk-Layer: 05
---
 cmd/sing-box/cmd_schema.go               | 2 ++
 cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_networkquality.go | 2 ++
 cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_stun.go           | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_schema.go b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_schema.go
index 73538125b..9994ec0b2 100644
--- a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_schema.go
+++ b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_schema.go
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
+//go:build !podkop_slim || podkop_full
+
 package main
 
 import (
diff --git a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_networkquality.go b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_networkquality.go
index 5f63571de..31ad9a4b9 100644
--- a/cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_networkquality.go
+++ b/cmd/sing-box/cmd_tools_networkquality.go
@@ -1,3 +1,5 @@
